{"title":"Lifetime Expected Consumption","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/917682503/0/marginalrevolution~Lifetime-Expected-Consumption.html","date":1746271074000,"content":"<p>What does it mean to be wealthy and how should we factor in say, life expectancy? <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/1917600647211352109\">Lyman Stone</a> offers an interesting measure, lifetime consumption, taking in account (roughly) both years lived and how much one consumes in those years. <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GpyvoAPWUAAX05p?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" alt=\"Image\" /></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/lifetime-expected-consumption.html\">Lifetime Expected Consumption</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/917682503/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/917682503/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/917682503/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fpbs.twimg.com%2fmedia%2fGpyvoAPWUAAX05p%3fformat%3djpg%26amp%3bname%3dmedium\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/917682503/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/917682503/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/917682503/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com